# Assist U2 Win — App Environment Palette (LOCKED)

**Do not change these values** unless the user explicitly requests a palette update.
**Do not** scatter duplicate hex/rgba in components — use CSS variables from `app/globals.css`.

## Single source of truth

All tokens live in `app/globals.css` `:root`. Root `body` uses `.midnight-canvas-gradient`.

## 1. Primary background (large surfaces)

| Variable | Value | Use |
|----------|-------|-----|
| `--bg1` | `#080C1A` | Gradient top (deep base) |
| `--bg2` | `#0B1020` | Gradient mid |
| `--bg3` | `#050713` | Gradient bottom |
| `--accent-glow` | `rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12)` | Top-right cyan radial |
| `--bg-canvas` | linear + radial composite | Full app background |

**Usage:** `body.midnight-canvas-gradient` or `var(--bg-canvas)` — never legacy plum stops (`#352a42`, `#1a1524`) or flat `#141A30` / `#0E1222`.

## 2. Panels & cards

| Variable | Value | Use |
|----------|-------|-----|
| `--panel` | `#111827` | Solid panel base |
| `--panel2` | `#161C31` | Nested / internal panels |
| `--panel-alpha` | `rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.82)` | Glass `.panel` class |
| `--row-surface` | `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045)` | List rows / matrix cells |
| `--panel-featured` | `rgba(22, 28, 49, 0.75)` | Featured cyan-edge cards |

**Usage:** class `.panel` (blur 24px) or `AgentCommandShell` `PANEL` / `CARD_NORMAL`.

## 3. Borders & accents

| Variable | Value | Use |
|----------|-------|-----|
| `--line` | `#1E2A44` | Default panel border |
| `--row-line` | `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` | Row dividers |
| `--cyan` | `#00F2FE` | Featured borders, active UI |

## 4. Semantic UI

| Variable | Value | Use |
|----------|-------|-----|
| `--text-primary` | `#F8FAFC` | Headings |
| `--text-muted` | `#94A3B8` | Labels, sub-text |
| `--cyan` | `#00F2FE` | KPIs, active links |
| `--semantic-success` | `#18E28F` | Ready / cash |
| `--semantic-warning` | `#FFBD59` | Friction / pending |
| `--semantic-danger` | `#FF4F7B` | Risk |

## Shell rule

`APP_SHELL_BG` must stay **transparent** so the root gradient is visible. Do not paint a flat `--bg1` over the full shell.

## Scope

- **Do** adjust only `app/globals.css` for palette changes.
- **Do not** change layout, spacing, typography, or component structure when updating colors.
